sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant Store
    loop Up to three attempts
        Client->>API: Save draft
        API->>Store: Write revision
        alt Write succeeds
            Store-->>API: Revision saved
            opt Notify collaborators
                API--)Client: Draft updated
            end
            API-->>Client: Saved
        else Temporary failure
            Store-->>API: Busy
            API-->>Client: Try again
        end
        break Client cancels
            Client->>API: Stop saving
        end
    end
